{"data":[{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:27:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112581595471176099"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"And other findings from IFS’ new international survey!","display_url":"lymanstone.substack.com/p/babies-are-n…","end":94,"expanded_url":"https://lymanstone.substack.com/p/babies-are-not-for-cowards","images":[{"height":800,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112581596612026369/ZXPMc243?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1600},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112581596612026369/ZXPMc243?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":71,"status":200,"title":"Babies Are Not For Cowards","unwound_url":"https://lymanstone.substack.com/p/babies-are-not-for-cowards","url":"https://t.co/EeJwu2PeEn"},{"display_url":"x.com/WendyRWang/sta…","end":118,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/WendyRWang/status/2112576159271493636","start":95,"url":"https://t.co/N0Lkrtwvz4"}]},"id":"2112581595471176099","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":960,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"And I've written up a bunch of further elaboration on this issue here: https://t.co/EeJwu2PeEn https://t.co/N0Lkrtwvz4","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112581595471176099"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112572941250555904","3_2112572941254729728"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:54:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112573126869737646"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":136,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":127,"username":"PeterRFB"},{"end":154,"id":"2351126707","start":139,"username":"DrJasonCarroll"},{"end":186,"id":"1665459757","start":175,"username":"FamStudies"},{"end":263,"id":"718156043528900608","start":247,"username":"alexandracooper"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Zg2SIHJMjA","end":289,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112573126869737646/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112572941250555904","start":266,"url":"https://t.co/Zg2SIHJMjA"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Zg2SIHJMjA","end":289,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112573126869737646/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112572941254729728","start":266,"url":"https://t.co/Zg2SIHJMjA"},{"display_url":"x.com/nypost/status/…","end":313,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/nypost/status/2112533942372856261","start":290,"url":"https://t.co/0DwtTnHJ4c"}]},"id":"2112573126869737646","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2645,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":9},"text":"When celebrities people admire have more children, the people who admire them also desire and intend to have more children, as @PeterRFB , @DrJasonCarroll , and I show in new @FamStudies research!\n\nWay to BE THE CHANGE WE WANT TO SEE IN THE WORLD @alexandracooper ! https://t.co/Zg2SIHJMjA https://t.co/0DwtTnHJ4c","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112573126869737646"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112570176520564737","3_2112571884441079808"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:50:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112572284473082269"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":143,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":134,"username":"PeterRFB"},{"end":159,"id":"2351126707","start":144,"username":"DrJasonCarroll"},{"end":259,"id":"1665459757","start":248,"username":"FamStudies"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/vjPy6q7sQ0","end":283,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112572284473082269/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112570176520564737","start":260,"url":"https://t.co/vjPy6q7sQ0"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/vjPy6q7sQ0","end":283,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112572284473082269/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112571884441079808","start":260,"url":"https://t.co/vjPy6q7sQ0"}]},"id":"2112572284473082269","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":3654,"like_count":44,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":10},"text":"The 21st century fertility decline is driven by falling 1st (and to some extent 2nd) births. \n\nDeclining marriage is one cause. \n\nBut @PeterRFB @DrJasonCarroll and I show that unsupportive friends may uniquely shape 1st/2nd birth decisions too! cc @FamStudies https://t.co/vjPy6q7sQ0","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112572284473082269"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:38:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112569188623823263"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/BenJames_____/…","end":112,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/BenJames_____/status/2112481321058505177","start":89,"url":"https://t.co/TYrXjxsLbY"}]},"id":"2112569188623823263","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4539,"like_count":99,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":3},"text":"The Prime Minister's direct AI advisor will be paid less than $40,000\n\nunserious country https://t.co/TYrXjxsLbY","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112569188623823263"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:29:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112566998962160071"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/KobiHackenburg…","end":146,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/KobiHackenburg/status/2112524951236522349","start":123,"url":"https://t.co/g68cqjXj7J"}]},"id":"2112566998962160071","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1019,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"clearly what drives signing is, duh, compliance bias with being given an option to sign while taking a compensated survey. https://t.co/g68cqjXj7J","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112566998962160071"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:16:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112563624157823363"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/scottlincicome…","end":29,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/scottlincicome/status/2112559617251369330","start":6,"url":"https://t.co/GNzwQ6HJZ5"}]},"id":"2112563624157823363","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":977,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"oh NO https://t.co/GNzwQ6HJZ5","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112563624157823363"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112560243611770880"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:05:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112560833070854353"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":68,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":59,"username":"PeterRFB"},{"end":88,"id":"2351126707","start":73,"username":"DrJasonCarroll"},{"end":120,"id":"1665459757","start":109,"username":"FamStudies"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/IgkzsfTzGe","end":274,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112560833070854353/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112560243611770880","start":251,"url":"https://t.co/IgkzsfTzGe"}]},"id":"2112560833070854353","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":2705,"like_count":17,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":6},"text":"What makes people want or intend to have more kids?\n\nWell, @PeterRFB and @DrJasonCarroll and I show in a new @FamStudies report that one simple answer may be: friends who are more supportive of them having kids!\n\nPeer influences matter for fertility. https://t.co/IgkzsfTzGe","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112560833070854353"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112560648005484545"]},"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:05:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112560723603632217"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":108,"id":"2031457713868386305","start":95,"username":"NASAMoonBase"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tal41Kyght","end":295,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112560723603632217/video/1","media_key":"13_2112560648005484545","start":272,"url":"https://t.co/tal41Kyght"}]},"id":"2112560723603632217","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":180,"impression_count":522356,"like_count":3413,"quote_count":59,"reply_count":232,"retweet_count":498},"text":"There's a lot of ground to cover when you're building a Moon Base. \n\nDuring the first phase of @NASAMoonBase development, robotic rovers will gather new details about the lunar South Pole region, while lunar terrain vehicles will extend the reach of each Artemis mission. https://t.co/tal41Kyght","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112560723603632217"},{"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:00:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112559638579499258"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Q3 2026 Financial and Operational Results","display_url":"x.com/i/broadcasts/1…","end":96,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1PKqrNbLZbPGb","images":[{"height":658,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112551855788023810/FFsART3d?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112551855788023810/FFsART3d?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":73,"status":200,"title":"SpaceX","unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1PKqrNbLZbPGb","url":"https://t.co/Qrb0qeVG15"}]},"id":"2112559638579499258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1263,"impression_count":2822987,"like_count":6648,"quote_count":200,"reply_count":569,"retweet_count":956},"text":"Watch live as SpaceX discusses our Q3 2026 earnings at 3:30pm CT today → https://t.co/Qrb0qeVG15","url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112559638579499258"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112559465027547449"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/patrick_saner/…","end":39,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/patrick_saner/status/2112501878873260375","start":16,"url":"https://t.co/lo92e1FFsp"}]},"id":"2112559465027547449","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":977,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"JUST LIKE US!!! https://t.co/lo92e1FFsp","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112559465027547449"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:54:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112558196560703642"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/lillybilly299/…","end":233,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/lillybilly299/status/2112557686331944977","start":210,"url":"https://t.co/NrpU8V6hrX"}]},"id":"2112558196560703642","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":8353,"like_count":154,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":4},"text":"A paradigmatic common dispute between spouses is that they do things different ways. In practice, \"done\" is often the desired result; it is often better if they do not watch how each other achieve that result. https://t.co/NrpU8V6hrX","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112558196560703642"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112553113294974976"]},"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:34:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112553116390269175"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"The Republic of Uzbekistan became the 77th signatory of the Artemis Accords during a ceremony in Samarkand on Monday, committing to the practical principles","display_url":"go.nasa.gov/4hWoI2z","end":187,"expanded_url":"https://go.nasa.gov/4hWoI2z","images":[{"height":2250,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112553122706980864/yW6-cui7?format=jpg&name=orig","width":4000},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112553122706980864/yW6-cui7?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":164,"status":200,"title":"NASA Welcomes Uzbekistan as Newest Artemis Accords Signatory - NASA","unwound_url":"https://www.nasa.gov/organizations/oiir/artemis-accords/nasa-welcomes-uzbekistan-as-newest-artemis-accords-signatory/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASA&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=1024354216","url":"https://t.co/xjbRr1KmLH"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/sXI59ZklOk","end":211,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112553116390269175/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112553113294974976","start":188,"url":"https://t.co/sXI59ZklOk"}]},"id":"2112553116390269175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":65,"impression_count":843501,"like_count":1657,"quote_count":23,"reply_count":109,"retweet_count":183},"text":"Welcome to the Artemis Accords, Uzbekistan 🇺🇿\n\nUzbekistan has joined 76 other nations around the world by committing to the peaceful and safe exploration of space. https://t.co/xjbRr1KmLH https://t.co/sXI59ZklOk","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112553116390269175"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:31:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112552245548155279"],"id":"2112552245548155279","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":3959,"like_count":90,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"i think it's reasonable to say that most Americans do have competing, dual loyalties of some kind, and we should be able to discuss this nonpejoratively. in a \"choose one\" scenario i choose my church over my country. that's a kind of dual loyalty. saying that isn't insulting me.","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112552245548155279"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112551099613794305"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112551394456563762"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":105,"id":"1600613745453158401","start":94,"username":"MoreBirths"},{"end":261,"id":"1665459757","start":250,"username":"FamStudies"},{"end":271,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":262,"username":"PeterRFB"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/CNk2PIPSu7","end":295,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112551394456563762/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112551099613794305","start":272,"url":"https://t.co/CNk2PIPSu7"}]},"id":"2112551394456563762","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":2392,"like_count":43,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":9},"text":"We all know \"culture matters\" for fertility. But what actually makes a \"pronatal culture\" (as @MoreBirths often talks about)?\n\nEmpirically, a big part of it is just having friends who will go out of their way to support and celebrate a new baby.\n\ncc @FamStudies @PeterRFB https://t.co/CNk2PIPSu7","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112551394456563762"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112547668459180032","3_2112548729840349184","3_2112549106698600448"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:19:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112549381635194931"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":29,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":20,"username":"PeterRFB"},{"end":63,"id":"1665459757","start":52,"username":"FamStudies"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JwJrLB466S","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112549381635194931/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112547668459180032","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/JwJrLB466S"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JwJrLB466S","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112549381635194931/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112548729840349184","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/JwJrLB466S"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JwJrLB466S","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112549381635194931/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112549106698600448","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/JwJrLB466S"}]},"id":"2112549381635194931","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1821,"like_count":6,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"One VERY cool thing @PeterRFB and I did for our new @FamStudies report was survey people about the celebrities they admired.\n\nBut.... that got us curious!\n\nWhat was the real general fertility behavior of social and cultural elites? How would we know?\n\nTo assess this, we scraped https://t.co/JwJrLB466S","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112549381635194931"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112544840818868226"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:02:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112545113633419656"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":254,"id":"1665459757","start":243,"username":"FamStudies"},{"end":264,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":255,"username":"PeterRFB"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/jTxyubbtoR","end":288,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112545113633419656/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112544840818868226","start":265,"url":"https://t.co/jTxyubbtoR"}]},"id":"2112545113633419656","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":3141,"like_count":57,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":10},"text":"Where do people most expect their friends would help them out with a new baby?\n\nDefinitely not Japan or Korea!\n\nIsraelis planning a first birth, however, anticipate getting LOTS of help!\n\nMaybe that helps explain Israel's unique fertility?\ncc @FamStudies @PeterRFB https://t.co/jTxyubbtoR","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112545113633419656"},{"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-20T13:56:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112543527481876848"],"id":"2112543527481876848","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":92,"impression_count":1585083,"like_count":6597,"quote_count":27,"reply_count":163,"retweet_count":342},"text":"Payload deployment sequence is complete","url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112543527481876848"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112539885429043230"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":81,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":72,"username":"PeterRFB"},{"end":233,"id":"19417492","start":229,"username":"NRO"}],"urls":[{"description":"Residents of mainland China are more concerned than any other population about discrimination based on family size, a new study finds.","display_url":"nationalreview.com/news/china-is-…","end":278,"expanded_url":"https://www.nationalreview.com/news/china-is-still-haunted-by-its-one-child-policy/","images":[{"height":1200,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112539339121205248/wlWCJL2A?format=jpg&name=orig","width":2057},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112539339121205248/wlWCJL2A?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start